   "proposition": "The English shows a second, displayed (eval=F) code chunk giving the reader the runnable import command linelist <- appliedepidata::get_data(name = \"linelist_cleaned_rds\"); in Spanish that chunk is commented out with leading '#' on all three fence lines, so it is no longer a code chunk and has no counterpart segment.",
